en={'nav1':'THE SPACE','nav2':'TOOLS','nav3':'YOUR SESSION','intro1':'LESS WAITING.','intro2':'MORE MAKING.','hero':'A shared workshop for people who turn ideas into things. Bring your drawing, find your bench, and make something that deserves to exist. Space, tools and a second pair of hands. All under one roof.','aboutlabel':'01 / A PLACE TO BEGIN','about':'You don’t need your own workshop to do your own thing.','aboutbody':'A workbench for the afternoon. A machine for the one cut you cannot make at home. Someone who knows which way the grain runs. Bench makes room for the work, however small the beginning.','caption':'A / METAL SHOP — CUT, SHAPE, FINISH','captiondetail':'SHARED TOOLS. INDIVIDUAL IDEAS.','toolslabel':'02 / WHAT’S ON THE FLOOR','tools':'Good tools.<br>In good company.','tool1':'WOOD','tool2':'METAL','tool3':'ASSEMBLY','td1':'Bench saw · planer · drill press · hand tools','td2':'Bandsaw · pillar drill · deburring station','td3':'Large tables · clamps · measuring tools','rule':'First visit? Start with an induction. Machine access follows a supervised introduction.','sessionlabel':'03 / MAKE ROOM FOR YOUR NEXT IDEA','session':'Start<br>something.','sessioncopy':'Estimate a sample bench session. This is a fictional shared-workshop concept; the estimate is calculated on your device and does not reserve a space.','hours':'Hours at the bench','area':'Workshop area','opt1':'Wood bench — €12 / hour','opt2':'Metal bench — €16 / hour','opt3':'Assembly table — €8 / hour','calculate':'Calculate session ↗','result':'{hours} hours / {area}: {total}. Materials and induction are separate. This is an estimate, not a booking.','areas':['Wood bench','Metal bench','Assembly table'],'footer':'BENCH® / ROOM TO MAKE','concept':'FICTIONAL WORKSHOP · DESIGN CONCEPT','replay':'Replay intro','skip':'Skip intro','back':'BACK TO TOP ↗'}
